# Merge and push to `main`

When this agent finishes verified work on this repository:

1. **Commit** on a `cursor/<topic>-a60f` branch if the cloud workflow requires it, then **merge into `main`** (fast-forward or merge commit as appropriate).
2. **`git push origin main`** so CAI and other consumers can `git pull origin main` immediately.
3. Do **not** leave fixes only on a feature branch or open PR without also updating `main`, unless the user explicitly asks for a PR-only or no-push workflow.

If a PR was opened for tracking, merge or fast-forward `main` to include the same commits and push `main` anyway.
